        "id": "p7-q12-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "four letters?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1}{8}$",
          "worked": "There are 100 boys whose surnames contain four letters.\n\n$$P(\\text{four letters})=\\frac{100}{800}=\\frac{1}{8}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q12-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "more than eight letters?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{33}{400}$",
          "worked": "More than eight letters means 9, 10 or 11 letters. The favourable count is $51+13+2=66$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{more than eight letters})&=\\frac{51+13+2}{800}\\\\P(\\text{more than eight letters})&=\\frac{66}{800}\\\\P(\\text{more than eight letters})&=\\frac{33}{400}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q12-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "less than five letters?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{29}{200}$",
          "worked": "Less than five letters means 3 or 4 letters. The favourable count is $16+100=116$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{less than five letters})&=\\frac{16+100}{800}\\\\P(\\text{less than five letters})&=\\frac{116}{800}\\\\P(\\text{less than five letters})&=\\frac{29}{200}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 26
      }
    ]
